*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0027
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 750
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0027.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0027C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 ACCT-STAT-CD       PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 4000-REPEAT-LATE
    PERFORM REFER-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STAT-CD=" ACCT-STAT-CD
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
4000-REPEAT-LATE.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF LATE-PMTS-YR >= 2
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF LATE-PMTS-YR NOT < 3 AND DAYS-LATE GREATER THAN 30
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
        ADD 100 TO LATE-FEE
    END-IF.
REFER-COLLECTIONS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF DAYS-LATE > 48
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF DAYS-LATE GREATER THAN 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STAT-CD
    END-IF.
